# CQ03 [Structural components] What are the mechanical properties of the hub?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?hub ?property ?value ?unit WHERE {
  ?hub a optimar:Hub ; ?property ?v .
  VALUES ?property { optimar:diameter optimar:mass optimar:momentOfInertia }
  ?v qudt:numericValue ?value ; qudt:unit ?unit .
}
